{"id": 75800191, "slug": "the-dollar-squeeze-heads-to-china", "title": "The Dollar Squeeze Heads to China", "subtitle": "", "post_date": "2022-09-30T16:23:48.033Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 563, "reaction_count": 5, "comment_count": 0, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 5}, "body_html": "<p>Last year, we told you Evergrande was dead.</p><p>A year later, the entire Chinese property sector is on the ropes, with bonds now pricing in $1Tr+ of losses against &lt;$500bn of mkt cap.</p><p>Here\u2019s why this matters and why this is bullish for dollars and gold.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ba2B!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe992078d-4cb7-4bd9-bc25-3d688dcbcd0d_1032x645.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ba2B!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe992078d-4cb7-4bd9-bc25-3d688dcbcd0d_1032x645.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ba2B!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe992078d-4cb7-4bd9-bc25-3d688dcbcd0d_1032x645.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ba2B!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fe992078d-4cb7-4bd9-bc25-3d688dcbcd0d_1032x645.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ba2B!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fbucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%